    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "chr Gande",
      "Welcome Aboard AmericanAirlines\nBeverages\nA choice of spirits and cocktails is available at $1.50\nAmerican beer is available at $1.00\nSpecially selected wines are available at $1.00\nAmerican champagne is available at $1.00\nA selection of cordials is available at $1.50\nTomato Juice, Orange Juice, Cocal\nla and other soft drinks\nFreshly Brewed Coffee, Tea, Milk and Sanka\nWith its origins stretching back as far as those of our nation.\nthe American folk tradition is one that is still a living part of our\nheritage today. The signing of the Declaration of Independence\nin 1776 created a new spirit of unity across the country. As this spirit\nflourished, our own ethnic art grew and became a greater part of\nthe lives of working Americans. Farmers, teachers and tradesmen\nbecame artists in addition to their daily occupations.\nThe painting, \"Mahantago Valley Farm\", was done by an unknown\nartist in Pennsylvania about 1860. Courtesy of National Gallery\nof Art, Washington, D.C., Gift of Edgar Williams and Bernice\nChrysler Garbisch.\nMenu\nAppetizer\nSpecially chosen to tempt your palate\nand complement your entree selection.\nEntree Selections\nFarmer's Omelette\nA fluffy egg omelette filled with smoked\nham, sliced mushrooms and green\npeppers. Brochette of sirloin and petite\nsausage.\nTurkey Crepe\nTender Crepes with a seasoned\nturkey and brandy cream sauce\nfilling and glazed with an almond\nand swiss cheese topping. Apple\nCranberry Compote.\nFrench Toast\nSlices of sour dough bread, batter\ndipped and\ntoasted,\nserved with\na rich raspberry and orange sauce.\nPetite sausage links.\nSweet Cake and Butter\nPlease accept our apology if occasionally your selection is not available.\n2006.034.025"
